    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 101,
      "text": "What the ledger says is his"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The application came back approved in principle, which is the clan's way of saying the argument has been moved to a room I am allowed into. Pulled the asset records myself rather than asking for a summary.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "The squeeze starts on paper. Spawn point sits beside the hall, not a hundred and ninety paces away.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "fang-qiu",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
      "actor": "fang-qiu",
      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 102,
      "text": "Chapter 102"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The records are clear and my uncle's position is not. He has been managing property he does not own and reporting the management as ownership for six years.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 103,
      "text": "Chapter 103"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Filed the discrepancy. Not as an accusation — as a clerical question. A clerical question is answered by a clerk, and a clerk's answer becomes a document.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 104,
      "text": "Chapter 104"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Man Shi carried the record boxes for me because I asked him to and nobody else ever has. He is a head taller than the room and entirely unaware of it. Useful, and not in the way people assume.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "choice",
      "id": "act3.assets.petition.method",
      "prompt": "How do you make the case?",
      "method": "assets",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "paper",
          "label": "On the dates, and only the dates.",
          "method": "paper"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure",
          "label": "Through people who owe you.",
          "method": "pressure"
        },
        {
          "id": "patience",
          "label": "File it and wait for the hall to be busy.",
          "method": "patience"
        }
      ]
    },
